ABILITY:Magus Arcana|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Magus Arcana ~ Accurate Strike|TYPE:Extraordinary.MagusArcana.SpecialQuality|DESC:The magus can expend 2 points from his arcane pool as a swift action to resolve all of his melee weapon attacks until the end of his turn as melee touch attacks. The magus must be at least 9th level before selecting this arcana.
ABILITY:Magus Arcana|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Magus Arcana ~ Close Range|TYPE:SpecialAttack.Extraordinary.MagusArcana|DESC:You can deliver ray spells that feature a ranged touch attack as melee touch spells. You can use a ranged touch attack spell that targets more than one creature (such as Scorching Ray), but you make only one melee touch attack to deliver one of these ranged touch effects; additional ranged touch attacks from that spell are wasted and have no effect. These spells can be used with the spellstrike class feature.
ABILITY:Magus Arcana|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Magus Arcana ~ Dispelling Strike|TYPE:SpecialAttack.Supernatural.MagusArcana|DESC:You can spend 1 or more points from your arcane pool as a swift action to imbue your weapon with a special power.  If the weapon strikes a creature within the next minute, that creature is the subject of a targeted Dispel Magic using your level as the caster level, except that this effect cannot dispel a spell of a level higher than the number of arcane pool points expended to activate this ability (treat higher-level spells as if they do not exist and apply the dispel attempt to the remaining spells with the highest caster level). Once the strike is made, the power dissipates, even if the dispel attempt is unsuccessful.
ABILITY:Magus Arcana|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:Special Ability|KEY:Magus Arcana ~ Empowered Magic|TYPE:SpecialQuality.Supernatural.MagusArcana|DESC:You can cast one spell per day as if it were modified by the Empower Spell feat. This does not increase the casting time or the level of the spell.
USERPOOL:Magus Arcana|POOLPOINTS:0.0
ABILITY:Magus Bonus Feat|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Improved Critical|APPLIEDTO:Rapier|TYPE:Combat.OracleWeaponMastery|DESC:Attacks made with your chosen weapon are quite deadly.
ABILITY:Magus Bonus Feat|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Weapon Focus|APPLIEDTO:Rapier|TYPE:Combat.WeaponFocus.OracleWeaponMastery|DESC:You are especially good at using your chosen weapon.
